\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]apollo's root filesystem regains roughly 100G of free space without[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]disturbing running agents, and per-launch cargo targets plus [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]per-checkout pytest scratch are reclaimed automatically so the disk[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]does not refill.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]1[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] wave[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]apollo_disk_reclaim_1.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/apollo_disk_reclaim_1.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-10r[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-10r/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Emergency reclaim on apollo[/bold #D7AFFF]                                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]apollo-emergency-reclaim[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]apollo-emergency-reclaim: over ssh with no repo changes, delete finished[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agents' cargo targets, stale zorg target dirs, trashed pre-cutover SASE [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trees, stale pytest scratch, and legacy cargo strays, with liveness [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guards and before/after df accounting.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Runner-exit scratch cleanup and low-free-space pressure [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]reaping[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]agent-scratch-exit-cleanup[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent-scratch-exit-cleanup: remove the runner's launch-assigned [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cargo-targets and agent-tmp directories at exit, and use a 1h pressure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]min age whenever the free-space floor is breached regardless of which [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pressure trigger fired, with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reap sibling pytest scratch roots[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]pytest-scratch-sibling-reap[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pytest-scratch-sibling-reap: make tools/run_pytest also reap stale runs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in other /var/tmp/sase-<sha8> roots owned by the user and remove empty [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale roots, with tests.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-10r","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-10r.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-bc13755efba9924701bf4c2fa5d2b4d2","started_at":"2026-09-14T10:59:56.150674+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10r","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10r.1","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10r.2","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10r.3","bbugyi200.kellys_mbp.sase-10r.land"]}
